  larder put out, over the whole sweep: 96000-4386960 J, against a need near 46,800 J
    for 52 ants over 24,000 frames -- so these colonies are provisioned, not starved.
  intake off anything that is not the larder is ASSERTED to be 0 in every row, not printed.

  `self` vs `mute` is the real question: do the ants' OWN trails do anything?
  `visitors` is DISTINCT ants that reached the food over distinct ants that ever lived --
    recruitment, which `near` ant-ticks cannot see: 50 visitors and 1 resident read alike.
  `trips` is nest -> food -> nest, closed on the RETURN. `reach` buckets every ant by how
  `occupancy` is ant-ticks in 8 equal bands, NEST END FIRST, food end last -- a commuting
    colony is bimodal, a dispersing one slides its mass right, a homebody is a spike at 0.
  `carry->nest` is signed cells moved while holding larder, POSITIVE = homeward. Near zero
    means food is picked up and wandered with, which is a different fault from not finding it.
    far it ever got, as a share of the gap, so a commuting population is visible as a shape.
  `hand` vs `self` only says whether a laid ramp beats what they bootstrap.
  `hmute` is the DECAY BASELINE for `route pk`: our ramp laid, the ants silenced.
  `flatN`/`flatF` are the POLARITY metric's negative controls: a FLAT channel A blob over
    the nest half / the food half, ants' EmitA silenced. A field with no ramp in it at all.
    A correct metric reads 0 on both. POLARITY|| is predicted to read ~+0.12 and ~-0.12,
    which brackets every polarity figure in the report -- see `lay_flat`.
  `homeA` lays a channel A HOMING ramp and no food trail -- if laden ants only fail
    to route because they cannot find their way home, this is where their own B appears.
  `carry` is ant-ticks holding larder in the crop; `carry@nest` is those inside the +-26 nest band --
    that pair is the answer to "is food being carried back", which a cell census cannot give.
  `other J` must read 0 in every row: it is the check that `onlyfood` held.
  A gap where `alive` reaches 0 in every arm is measuring a dead colony, not a deaf one.
